The catalogue text — every card, every hook, the prose on the page and in README.md,
and the scripts in tools/ — is released under the MIT licence below.

The photographs in images/ are NOT covered by it. Each one comes from Wikimedia
Commons under its own licence, and stays under it. credits.js records, for every
image: the Commons file it came from, the photographer, the licence short name and
the file description page. Reuse an image under its own terms, not under this one.

